docs {
  # Admin - Hard Delete Report

  **Method:** `DELETE`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/reports/:id/hard`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token)

  ## Description
  Permanently and irreversibly removes the report record from the database.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | `int64` | Yes | Unique ID of the report to permanently delete |

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "report permanently deleted"
    }
  }
  ```
  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid report ID format
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Insufficient permissions (requires ADMIN role)
  * `404 Not Found` — Report not found
}
